#: drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:230
msgid ""
"Name=You might want to send a bug report for this application. Check if it is "
"listed on http://bugs.kde.org, otherwise mail the author. Please include as "
"much information as possible, maybe the original documents. If you have a way "
"to reproduce the error, include this also."
msgstr ""
"Name=Sal jy asb. 'n fout vir hierdie program aanmeld? Kyk of dit by "
"http://bugs.kde.org gelys is, anders kan jy die outeur direk kontak. Sluit "
"soveel inligting as moontlik in. Sluit ook die stappe in as jy weet hoe om die "
"fout te aktiveer."

#: drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:286
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGILL signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment='n aansoek meestal ontvang die Sigill sein as gevolg na 'n fout in die "
"aansoek. die aansoek was gevra na stoor sy dokumente."

#: drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:360
msgid ""
"Comment=An application terminates with a SIGABRT signal when it detects an "
"internal inconsistency caused by a bug in the program."
msgstr ""
"Comment='n aansoek termineer met 'n Sigabrt sein wanneer dit bespeur 'n intern "
"onkonsekwentheid veroorsaak deur 'n fout in die program."

#: drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:432
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGFPE signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment='n aansoek meestal ontvang die Sigfpe sein as gevolg na 'n fout in die "
"aansoek. die aansoek was gevra na stoor sy dokumente."

#: drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:505
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGSEGV signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment='n aansoek meestal ontvang die Sigsegv sein as gevolg na 'n fout in die "
"aansoek. die aansoek was gevra na stoor sy dokumente."

#: drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:650
msgid "Comment=Sorry, I do not know this signal."
msgstr "Comment=Jammer, ek ken nie hierdie sein nie."

